ram appears within 1 second of page load\"\n    ],\n    \"passes\": false\n  },\n  {\n    \"category\": \"performance\",\n    \"description\": \"Page with 5 diagrams loads in under 3 seconds total\",\n    \"steps\": [\n      \"Create arch/ with 5 .mmd files of moderate complexity\",\n      \"Open architecture page and measure total load time\",\n      \"Verify all 5 diagrams rendered within 3 seconds\"\n    ],\n    \"passes\": false\n  },\n  {\n    \"category\": \"performance\",\n    \"description\": \"First AI response token visible within 2 seconds of sending\",\n    \"steps\": [\n      \"Open chat, select provider/model, type a short message\",\n      \"Click send and start timer\",\n      \"Verify first token of AI response appears within 2 seconds\"\n    ],\n    \"passes\": false\n  },\n  {\n    \"category\": \"ui-ux\",\n    \"description\": \"Chat panel responsive layout works at different viewport widths\",\n    \"steps\": [\n      \"Open architecture page at 1920px width\",\n      \"Open chat panel, verify 60/40 split\",\n      \"Resize to 1024px, verify layout still usable\",\n      \"Resize to 768px, verify chat overlays diagrams (mobile-friendly)\"\n    ],\n    \"passes\": false\n  },\n  {\n    \"category\": \"ui-ux\",\n    \"description\": \"Diagram cards have loading skeleton while fetching content\",\n    \"steps\": [\n      \"Open architecture page\",\n      \"Verify each card shows loading skeleton/spinner while diagram fetches\",\n      \"Verify skeleton replaced by rendered diagram when complete\",\n      \"Verify loading states are independent per card\"\n    ],\n    \"passes\": false\n  },\n  {\n    \"category\": \"ui-ux\",\n    \"description\": \"Chat message input area handles diagram attachment chips cleanly\",\n    \"steps\": [\n      \"Attach 3 diagrams as chips\",\n      \"Verify chips wrap to multiple lines if needed\",\n      \"Verify text input area remains usable below chips\",\n      \"Remove a chip and verify layout adjusts\",\n      \"Verify chip displays diagram name (not filename)\"\n    ],\n    \"passes\": false\n  },\n  {\n    \"category\": \"security\",\n    \"description\": \"Server only serves files from within the arch/ directory (no path traversal)\",\n    \"steps\": [\n      \"GET /api/projects/{id}/features/{name}/arch/../../secrets.json\",\n      \"Verify server returns 400 or 404 (not file contents)\",\n      \"Verify path traversal is blocked\",\n      \"Verify only files listed in _arch.json are servable\"\n    ],\n    \"passes\": false\n  }\n]\n","numLines":325,"startLine":1,"totalLines":325}}}
