{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0167ia4PWeG6v5YRbTgh1Mo1","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Spec: Migration and Cleanup\n     2→\n     3→> Updated: 2026-02-15 — All acceptance criteria verified as complete\n     4→\n     5→## Overview\n     6→\n     7→Remove legacy diagram rendering, review system, and template generation code, updating the plan schema for the new arch-based approach.\n     8→\n     9→## Parent JTBD\n    10→\n    11→As a plugin maintainer, I want to remove the old monolithic diagram system so the codebase stays clean and the new file-based approach is the only path.\n    12→\n    13→## Scope\n    14→\n    15→**In Scope:**\n    16→- Remove plan JSON diagram sections (uiFlows, dataModels, dataFlow, services) from schema\n    17→- Remove custom SVG rendering code (template.html JavaScript)\n    18→- Remove standalone preview.py template generation\n    19→- Remove approve/reject review system (review schema, review routes, review UI, collect-review.py)\n    20→- Update plan schema to include `architecture.ref`\n    21→- Update setup-feature.py to scaffold arch/ directory\n    22→- Update plan skill workflow to generate arch/ files instead of plan JSON sections\n    23→\n    24→**Out of Scope:**\n    25→- New rendering pipeline (see rendering-pipeline spec)\n    26→- New chat review (see chat-review spec)\n    27→- Backward compatibility with old plan format (clean break)\n    28→\n    29→## Requirements\n    30→\n    31→### Functional\n    32→\n    33→1. `plan-schema.json` updated: remove required sections `uiFlows`, `dataModels`, `dataFlow`, `services`. Add optional `architecture` object with `ref` field. Keep `implementationPhases`.\n    34→2. Remove `vista/scripts/visualizer/template.html` (1,500+ lines of custom SVG)\n    35→3. Remove template generation logic from `vista/scripts/preview.py` (or repurpose to open web app URL)\n    36→4. Remove `vista/templates/review-schema.json`\n    37→5. Remove `POST /api/.../review` route and `ProgressService.read_review_json()` / `write_review_json()`\n    38→6. Remove `vista/scripts/collect-review.py`\n    39→7. Remove review UI code from `vista_preview.html` (approve/reject buttons, copy-to-clipboard)\n    40→8. Update `setup-feature.py` to create `arch/` directory and empty `_arch.json` alongside existing scaffolding\n    41→9. Update plan skill (`vista/skills/plan/SKILL.md`) workflow Steps 5-7 to generate .mmd files + _arch.json instead of plan JSON sections\n    42→\n    43→### Non-Functional\n    44→\n    45→- **Breaking:** This is a clean break. Existing _plan.json files with diagram sections will not render in the new system.\n    46→\n    47→## User Workflows\n    48→\n    49→### Workflow 1: Clean Break Migration\n    50→\n    51→**Actor:** Plugin maintainer\n    52→**Trigger:** Feature implementation\n    53→\n    54→**Steps:**\n    55→1. Update plan-schema.json\n    56→2. Remove legacy files (template.html, review-schema.json, collect-review.py)\n    57→3. Update server routes (remove review POST, update vista preview route)\n    58→4. Update progress_service.py (remove review methods, add arch methods)\n    59→5. Update setup-feature.py (scaffold arch/)\n    60→6. Update plan skill documentation\n    61→7. Test that new workflow generates arch/ files correctly\n    62→\n    63→**Error Cases:**\n    64→- Existing features with old plan JSON: They won't have an arch/ directory. The new view shows \"No architecture diagrams found\" with instructions.\n    65→\n    66→## Data Model\n    67→\n    68→**Removed Entities:**\n    69→- ReviewJSON (meta, sections with approve/reject/notes)\n    70→- Plan JSON sections: uiFlows, dataModels, dataFlow, services (as embedded diagram data)\n    71→\n    72→**Updated Entities:**\n    73→- PlanJSON: Now includes `architecture: { ref: string }` and only requires `meta`, `implementationPhases`\n    74→\n    75→## Integration Points\n    76→\n    77→**Dependencies:**\n    78→- None (this is cleanup)\n    79→\n    80→**Provides to:**\n    81→- Arch directory spec: Clean schema for new approach\n    82→- Rendering pipeline: Removed legacy rendering makes way for new pipeline\n    83→\n    84→## Technical Considerations\n    85→\n    86→### Files to Remove\n    87→\n    88→```\n    89→vista/scripts/visualizer/template.html     # Custom SVG rendering (1,500+ lines)\n    90→vista/scripts/collect-review.py            # Review clipboard collection\n    91→vista/templates/review-schema.json         # Review JSON schema\n    92→```\n    93→\n    94→### Files to Modify\n    95→\n    96→```\n    97→vista/templates/plan-schema.json           # Remove diagram sections, add architecture.ref\n    98→vista/scripts/preview.py                   # Repurpose or remove\n    99→vista/scripts/setup-feature.py             # Add arch/ scaffolding\n   100→vista/server/routes/plans.py               # Remove review route, update vista route\n   101→vista/server/services/progress_service.py  # Remove review methods, add arch methods\n   102→vista/server/views/vista_preview.html      # Complete rewrite for new rendering\n   103→vista/skills/plan/SKILL.md                 # Update Steps 5-7 for arch/ generation\n   104→```\n   105→\n   106→### Files to Keep As-Is\n   107→\n   108→```\n   109→vista/server/routes/projects.py            # Unchanged\n   110→vista/server/routes/providers.py           # Unchanged (reused by chat)\n   111→vista/server/routes/loops.py               # Unchanged\n   112→vista/server/routes/stream.py              # Unchanged\n   113→vista/server/views/_base.html              # Unchanged (base template)\n   114→vista/server/views/dashboard.html          # Unchanged\n   115→vista/server/views/project.html            # Unchanged\n   116→```\n   117→\n   118→## Acceptance Criteria\n   119→\n   120→- [x] plan-schema.json no longer requires uiFlows, dataModels, dataFlow, services\n   121→- [x] plan-schema.json includes architecture.ref field\n   122→- [x] template.html removed\n   123→- [x] collect-review.py removed\n   124→- [x] review-schema.json removed\n   125→- [x] Review POST route removed from plans.py\n   126→- [x] Review methods removed from progress_service.py\n   127→- [x] setup-feature.py creates arch/ directory and _arch.json\n   128→- [x] Plan skill documentation updated for arch/ generation workflow\n   129→\n   130→## Resolved Questions\n   131→\n   132→- preview.py has been fully removed (not repurposed). All 5 legacy files (template.html, collect-review.py, review-schema.json, preview.py, vista_preview.html) are deleted.\n   133→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5856037d-22b3-414c-9b3a-aae0b154d72e","uuid":"0234e83b-d3e9-41f1-82d9-235c7063b143","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/Users/Grove/OneDrive/Documents/PYTHON/claude_plugins/vista-expanded-visualization/.vista/features/diagram_representations/specs/migration-cleanup.md","content":"# Spec: Migration and Cleanup\n\n> Updated: 2026-02-15 — All acceptance criteria verified as complete\n\n## Overview\n\nRemove legacy diagram rendering, review system, and template generation code, updating the plan schema for the new arch-based approach.\n\n## Parent JTBD\n\nAs a plugin maintainer, I want to remove the old monolithic diagram system so the codebase stays clean and the new file-based approach is the only path.\n\n## Scope\n\n**In Scope:**\n- Remove plan JSON diagram sections (uiFlows, dataModels, dataFlow, services) from schema\n- Remove custom SVG rendering code (template.html JavaScript)\n- Remove standalone preview.py template generation\n- Remove approve/reject review system (review schema, review routes, review UI, collect-review.py)\n- Update plan schema to include `architecture.ref`\n- Update setup-feature.py to scaffold arch/ directory\n- Update plan skill workflow to generate arch/ files instead of plan JSON sections\n\n**Out of Scope:**\n- New rendering pipeline (see rendering-pipeline spec)\n- New chat review (see chat-review spec)\n- Backward compatibility with old plan format (clean break)\n\n## Requirements\n\n### Functional\n\n1. `plan-schema.json` updated: remove required sections `uiFlows`, `dataModels`, `dataFlow`, `services`. Add optional `architecture` object with `ref` field. Keep `implementationPhases`.\n2. Remove `vista/scripts/visualizer/template.html` (1,500+ lines of custom SVG)\n3. Remove template generation logic from `vista/scripts/preview.py` (or repurpose to open web app URL)\n4. Remove `vista/templates/review-schema.json`\n5. Remove `POST /api/.../review` route and `ProgressService.read_review_json()` / `write_review_json()`\n6. Remove `vista/scripts/collect-review.py`\n7. Remove review UI code from `vista_preview.html` (approve/reject buttons, copy-to-clipboard)\n8. Update `setup-feature.py` to create `arch/` directory and empty `_arch.json` alongside existing scaffolding\n9. Update plan skill (`vista/skills/plan/SKILL.md`) workflow Steps 5-7 to generate .mmd files + _arch.json instead of plan JSON sections\n\n### Non-Functional\n\n- **Breaking:** This is a clean break. Existing _plan.json files with diagram sections will not render in the new system.\n\n## User Workflows\n\n### Workflow 1: Clean Break Migration\n\n**Actor:** Plugin maintainer\n**Trigger:** Feature implementation\n\n**Steps:**\n1. Update plan-schema.json\n2. Remove legacy files (template.html, review-schema.json, collect-review.py)\n3. Update server routes (remove review POST, update vista preview route)\n4. Update progress_service.py (remove review methods, add arch methods)\n5. Update setup-feature.py (scaffold arch/)\n6. Update plan skill documentation\n7. Test that new workflow generates arch/ files correctly\n\n**Error Cases:**\n- Existing features with old plan JSON: They won't have an arch/ directory. The new view shows \"No architecture diagrams found\" with instructions.\n\n## Data Model\n\n**Removed Entities:**\n- ReviewJSON (meta, sections with approve/reject/notes)\n- Plan JSON sections: uiFlows, dataModels, dataFlow, services (as embedded diagram data)\n\n**Updated Entities:**\n- PlanJSON: Now includes `architecture: { ref: string }` and only requires `meta`, `implementationPhases`\n\n## Integration Points\n\n**Dependencies:**\n- None (this is cleanup)\n\n**Provides to:**\n- Arch directory spec: Clean schema for new approach\n- Rendering pipeline: Removed legacy rendering makes way for new pipeline\n\n## Technical Considerations\n\n### Files to Remove\n\n```\nvista/scripts/visualizer/template.html     # Custom SVG rendering (1,500+ lines)\nvista/scripts/collect-review.py            # Review clipboard collection\nvista/templates/review-schema.json         # Review JSON schema\n```\n\n### Files to Modify\n\n```\nvista/templates/plan-schema.json           # Remove diagram sections, add architecture.ref\nvista/scripts/preview.py                   # Repurpose or remove\nvista/scripts/setup-feature.py             # Add arch/ scaffolding\nvista/server/routes/plans.py               # Remove review route, update vista route\nvista/server/services/progress_service.py  # Remove review methods, add arch methods\nvista/server/views/vista_preview.html      # Complete rewrite for new rendering\nvista/skills/plan/SKILL.md                 # Update Steps 5-7 for arch/ generation\n```\n\n### Files to Keep As-Is\n\n```\nvista/server/routes/projects.py            # Unchanged\nvista/server/routes/providers.py           # Unchanged (reused by chat)\nvista/server/routes/loops.py               # Unchanged\nvista/server/routes/stream.py              # Unchanged\nvista/server/views/_base.html              # Unchanged (base template)\nvista/server/views/dashboard.html          # Unchanged\nvista/server/views/project.html            # Unchanged\n```\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] plan-schema.json no longer requires uiFlows, dataModels, dataFlow, services\n- [x] plan-schema.json includes architecture.ref field\n- [x] template.html removed\n- [x] collect-review.py removed\n- [x] review-schema.json removed\n- [x] Review POST route removed from plans.py\n- [x] Review methods removed from progress_service.py\n- [x] setup-feature.py creates arch/ directory and _arch.json\n- [x] Plan skill documentation updated for arch/ generation workflow\n\n## Resolved Questions\n\n- preview.py has been fully removed (not repurposed). All 5 legacy files (template.html, collect-review.py, review-schema.json, preview.py, vista_preview.html) are deleted.\n","numLines":133,"startLine":1,"totalLines":133}}}
