ty:** LOW — MVP works without these\n   328→\n   329→### 5.1 Draw.io Embedded Viewer\n   330→- **Current:** `.drawio` rendered as raw XML in `<pre>` (architecture.html:304)\n   331→- **Target:** Embed via `https://viewer.diagrams.net/` iframe\n   332→- **Files:** `vista/server/views/architecture.html` only\n   333→- **Approach:** For drawio entries, create iframe with `src=\"https://viewer.diagrams.net/?...\"` and pass file content via URL encoding or postMessage\n   334→- **Spec:** rendering-pipeline.md:32-33\n   335→\n   336→### 5.2 SSE Streaming for Chat ✅ COMPLETE\n   337→- **Implemented:** Protocol-native streaming via `ProviderRouter` (not CLI subprocess)\n   338→- Claude: WebSocket streaming via `ClaudeWSClient` -> Companion server\n   339→- OpenCode: HTTP SSE streaming via `OpenCodeClient`\n   340→- SSE endpoint: `GET /api/projects/{id}/chat/sessions/{sid}/stream` delivers merged chat tokens + diagram change events\n   341→- Uses `sse_starlette.sse.EventSourceResponse` with per-session pub/sub queues\n   342→- **Note:** This replaced the original CLI subprocess approach entirely. The `ChatService` is now a deprecated placeholder.\n   343→\n   344→### 5.3 Markdown Rendering in Chat\n   345→- **Current:** Chat responses rendered as plain text\n   346→- **Target:** Render markdown (code blocks, lists, headers)\n   347→- **Library:** `marked.js` from CDN (already mentioned in AGENTS.md)\n   348→- **Files:** `architecture.html` — modify `addChatMessage()` function (line 401)\n   349→\n   350→---\n   351→\n   352→## Phase 6: Documentation Updates\n   353→\n   354→**Priority:** LOW\n   355→**Files:** `AGENTS.md`\n   356→\n   357→### Tasks\n   358→\n   359→- [ ] Update \"New Endpoints\" section: Architecture routes are implemented, not \"to implement\"\n   360→- [ ] Fix chat endpoint URL: `POST /api/projects/{project_id}/chat` (not `POST /api/chat/send`)\n   361→- [ ] Add architecture viewer URL pattern: `/project/{id}/arch/{feature_name}`\n   362→- [ ] Update project structure to show new files (routes/chat.py, services/chat_service.py)\n   363→- [ ] Remove reference to `preview.py` as legacy (already deleted)\n   364→- [ ] Update \"Chat Not Working\" troubleshooting once chat is implemented\n   365→\n   366→---\n   367→\n   368→## Completed Items (Verified by Source Analysis)\n   369→\n   370→### Architecture Directory Structure ✅\n   371→- `setup-feature.py` creates `arch/` + `_arch.json` (lines 38-49)\n   372→- `arch-schema.json` valid JSON Schema (64 lines, supports mermaid/drawio types, architecture/tdd categories)\n   373→- Schema supports diagramTypes: flowchart, sequence, state, er, gantt, architecture, wireframe, custom, logic-flow, decision-tree, test-contract\n   374→\n   375→### Server API for Architecture Files ✅\n   376→- `GET /api/projects/{id}/features/{name}/arch` — manifest (architecture.py:14-25)\n   377→- `GET /api/projects/{id}/features/{name}/arch/{filename}` — file content (architecture.py:28-47)\n   378→- `GET /project/{id}/arch/{feature_name}` — viewer page (architecture.py:50-63)\n   379→- Path traversal protection: strips to basename, rejects `..`, validates resolved path (progress_service.py:63-82)\n   380→- Router registered in app.py (line 39)\n   381→\n   382→### Web App Rendering ✅\n   383→- Mermaid.js from CDN (architecture.html:6)\n   384→- `mermaid.render()` client-side rendering (architecture.html:301-302)\n   385→- Dark theme with custom colors (architecture.html:272-285)\n   386→- Error handling per diagram card (architecture.html:307)\n   387→- Empty state placeholder when no diagrams (architecture.html:190-194)\n   388→- Zero custom SVG code — fully delegated to mermaid.js\n   389→\n   390→### Chat Panel UI ✅\n   391→- Floating toggle button bottom-right (architecture.html:75-96)\n   392→- Slide-out panel 40% width (architecture.html:57-74)\n   393→- Provider dropdown from `/api/providers` (architecture.html:353-372)\n   394→- Model dropdown from `/api/providers/{name}/models` (architec