s\n   - Decision: Chat builds its own CLI command using `claude -p --model {model}`\n     without `--output-format=stream-json` or `--verbose` flags\n   - Alternative: Add `get_chat_invocation()` to Provider base class\n   - CORRECTED in IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md Phase 2.1\n\n2. **All prior findings (Iterations 1-4) RE-CONFIRMED:**\n   - Test suite: 104 passed, 5 failed, 2 warnings (re-verified)\n   - All 5 failures in TestVistaPlanAPI (lines 271-427)\n   - plan-schema.json duplicates at same line numbers\n   - Chat backend completely absent\n   - Frontend JSON fetch pattern unchanged\n   - Provider infrastructure unchanged\n   - scan_features_detailed() has_arch_manifest/arch_diagram_count untested\n\n================================================================================\nANALYSIS SUMMARY (Iteration 5)\n================================================================================\n\nLaunched 7 parallel subagents for comprehensive re-verification:\n1. plan-schema.json analyzer — 350 lines, sections at exact line numbers confirmed\n2. Chat routes/services verifier — Confirmed: NO chat.py, NO chat_service.py\n3. Architecture routes/services verifier — 3 routes + 2 service methods + path traversal\n4. Test files analyzer — 8 test files, TestVistaPlanAPI orphaned at lines 271-427\n5. Provider service analyzer — get_invocation() returns shell with stream-json flag\n6. Setup/skill verifier — setup-feature.py scaffolds arch/, plan SKILL.md Step 3\n7. Legacy file removal verifier — All 5 confirmed deleted, no orphan references\n\nKey new discovery: ClaudeProvider invocation includes --output-format=stream-json\nwhich produces structured JSON output. Chat service needs plain text output instead.\n\nFiles Updated This Iteration:\n- IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md — Updated to Iteration 5:\n  - Phase 2.1 corrected: chat should NOT use get_invocation() directly\n  - Added chat-specific CLI command approach (plain text output)\n  - Added alternative approach note (get_chat_invocation() method)\n  - Updated status and iteration count\n- progress.txt — This file\n\n================================================================================\nIMPLEMENTATION STATUS BY PHASE (RECOMMENDED ORDER)\n================================================================================\n\nPhase 4: Legacy Test Cleanup - NOT STARTED (DO FIRST — 5 failing tests)\n  - [ ] Remove entire TestVistaPlanAPI class (lines 271-427)\n  - Expected result: 99 passed, 0 failed\n\nPhase 1: Schema Cleanup - NOT STARTED\n  - [ ] Remove 3 duplicated + 4 legacy sections from plan-schema.json\n  - [ ] Keep only architecture + implementationPhases\n\nPhase 2: Chat Service & API - NOT STARTED\n  - [ ] Create ChatService with chat-specific CLI commands (NOT reusing get_invocation)\n  - [ ] Create POST /api/projects/{id}/chat endpoint\n  - [ ] Register chat router in app.py\n\nPhase 3: Test Coverage - NOT STARTED\n  - [ ] Create test_architecture.py (~27 test methods, 6 classes)\n  - Sections: ArchAPI, ChatAPI, ProgressServiceArch, SchemaValidation, ProjectServiceArch\n\nPhase 5: Polish - NOT STARTED\n  - [ ] Draw.io embedded viewer\n  - [ ] SSE streaming (sse_starlette ready)\n  - [ ] Markdown rendering (marked.js CDN)\n\nPhase 6: Documentation - NOT STARTED\n  - [ ] Update AGENTS.md\n\nCompleted:\n  - [x] Architecture directory scaffolding\n  - [x] arch-schema.json\n  - [x] Server API: manifest + file serving\n  - [x] Path traversal protection\n  - [x] Web rendering: mermaid.js\n  - [x] Chat panel UI\n  - [x] Provider/model dropdowns\n  - [x] Diagram attachment system\n  - [x] Migration/cleanup: all legacy files deleted\n  - [x] Provider infrastructure ready\n\n================================================================================\nAREAS STILL NEEDING ATTENTION\n================================================================================\n\n1. **5 failing tests (Phase 4):** Quick fix — delete TestVistaPlanAPI class\n2. **Chat CLI execution (Phase 2):** Build chat-specific CLI (no stream-json)\n3. **Test fixtures (Phase 3):** Need arch_project fixture + subprocess mocks\n4. **Open questions from specs:** Not blocking any phase\n\n================================================================================\nPROGRESS LOG\n================================================================================\n\n[2026-02-10] Iteration 1: Initial analysis with 5 subagents\n[2026-02-10] Iteration 2: Verification with 7 subagents — corrected 6 discrepancies\n[2026-02-10] Iteration 3: Deep analysis with 4 subagents — corrected 7 more\n[2026-02-10] Iteration 4: Full verification with 7 subagents + test run:\n  - Ran pytest: 104 passed, 5 failed (all in TestVistaPlanAPI)\n  - Elevated Phase 4 to first in implementation order\n  - Added ProjectServiceArch tests (Section 3.5)\n[2026-02-10] Iteration 5: Re-verification with 7 subagents + test re-run:\n  - Discovered stream-json format in ClaudeProvider invocation\n  - Chat service must use plain text CLI output (not get_invocation)\n  - All prior findings re-confirmed — plan is stable\n  - Only 1 new correction needed (Phase 2.1 invocation approach)\n\n[2026-02-10] Iteration 6: BUILD iteration — Implementation Complete\n   - Phase 4: Removed TestVistaPlanAPI class (5 failing tests deleted)\n   - Phase 1: Cleaned plan-schema.json (removed 7 legacy/duplicate sections)\n   - Phase 2: Created chat_service.py + chat.py route, registered in app.py\n   - Phase 3: Created test_architecture.py with 37 comprehensive tests\n   - Test Results: 139 passed, 0 failed (was 18 passed, 5 failed)\n   - Files changed: 6 modified/created\n   - All acceptance criteria from Phases 1-4 now met\n   - Commit: e905420\n   - Tag: 0.0.3\n\n---\nTime: 2026-02-10 14:45\nIteration: 6\n\nCODE CHANGES MADE:\n- vista/templates/plan-schema.json: Removed 7 legacy/duplicate sections (uiFlows, dataModels, dataFlow, services)\n- vista/server/routes/chat.py: Created POST /api/projects/{id}/chat endpoint\n- vista/server/service