{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_013GWfajGpVYcErZQVjed9bi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All steps complete. Here's what was delivered:\n\n## Plan Summary\n\n**Commit:** `38cc1bb` on `feat/expanded-visualization`\n\nThe implementation plan covers 6 phases for the **multi-format diagram rendering & markdown editing** expansion:\n\n### Phase 1: Schema & Backend Foundation\n- Extend `arch-schema.json` type enum from 2 → 6 values (`plantuml`, `d2`, `graphviz`, `markdown`)\n- Add `write_arch_file()` to ProgressService (restricted to `.md` only for security)\n- Add `PUT /api/.../arch/{filename}` endpoint\n- Update content-type mapping for all new extensions\n- Add `plantuml_server_url` to settings\n- Extend diagram watcher to watch all 6 file types\n\n### Phase 2: Client-Side Renderer Infrastructure\n- Refactor from filename-based dispatch to manifest type-based dispatch\n- Implement 4 new renderers: PlantUML (server-side SVG fetch), D2 (WASM), Graphviz (WASM), Draw.io (iframe)\n- Lazy-load WASM modules only when needed\n\n### Phase 3: Markdown Renderer & Inline Editor\n- Render `.md` files via `marked.js` (already loaded)\n- Edit button on markdown cards only\n- View → Editing → Saving → View state machine\n- Ctrl+S save, Escape cancel keyboard shortcuts\n\n### Phase 4: Template & Watcher Integration\n- Pass manifest `type` to renderer dispatch\n- CDN script loading (eager for small, lazy for WASM)\n- PlantUML server URL injection from settings\n\n### Phase 5: Tests (~20 new tests)\n- PUT endpoint security (path traversal, extension whitelist)\n- Schema validation for all 6 types\n- Content-type tests, watcher extension tests\n\n### Phase 6: Documentation & Skill Updates"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":258,"cache_read_input_tokens":102106,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":258},"output_tokens