{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01SN92kVnNgYECMbdWR9UfwD","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→# Implementation Plan: diagram_representations\n     2→\n     3→**Status:** IMPLEMENTATION COMPLETE — Phases 1-4 delivered, Phase 5 partial (SSE streaming done, Draw.io deferred)\n     4→**Last Updated:** 2026-02-15 (Spec alignment pass: chat architecture updated to protocol-native, session persistence documented)\n     5→**Next Action:** Phase 5.1 (Draw.io viewer), Phase 6 (Documentation)\n     6→\n     7→---\n     8→\n     9→## Invalidation Findings (Iteration 5 — stream-json Format Discovery)\n    10→\n    11→| # | Previous Plan Claim | Verified Reality | Impact |\n    12→|---|---------------------|-----------------|--------|\n    13→| 1 | Phase 2 says \"Gets invocation snippet via `provider.get_invocation(shell)`\" then \"Read stdout, return response text\" | ClaudeProvider's `get_invocation()` uses `--output-format=stream-json` (provider_service.py:134,141). CLI output is structured JSON lines, NOT plain text. | Chat service must NOT reuse loop invocation template directly |\n    14→\n    15→**Decision:** The chat service should build its own CLI command for the Claude provider, using `claude -p --model $Model` **without** `--output-format=stream-json` or `--verbose`. This produces plain text output suitable for JSON `{response}` wrapping. OpenCodeProvider's invocation (`opencode run --model $Model $PromptContent`) already returns plain text. See updated Phase 2.1 below.\n    16→\n    17→### All Prior Findings Confirmed (Iterations 1-4 — Still Accurate)\n    18→- **Test suite: 104 passed, 5 failed, 2 warnings** — re-confirmed by running pytest\n    19→- 5 failing tests: all in `TestVistaPlanAPI` class (lines 271-427) testing removed endpoints\n    20→- plan-schema.json: 3 duplicated sections (uiFlows, dataModels, dataFlow) at exact line numbers + services once at 146-179\n    21→\n    22→### Iteration 6 — BUILD Iteration Results (All Phases 1-4 Complete)\n    23→\n    24→| Phase | Status | Tests | Files Changed |\n    25→|-------|--------|-------|---------------|\n    26→| 4 | ✅ COMPLETE | 139 passed, 0 failed (was 104 passed, 5 failed) | `test_api.py` — removed TestVistaPlanAPI class |\n    27→| 1 | ✅ COMPLETE | 139 passed, 0 failed | `plan-schema.json` — removed 7 legacy/duplicate sections |\n    28→| 2 | ✅ COMPLETE | 139 passed, 0 failed | `chat_service.py`, `chat.py`, `app.py` |\n    29→| 3 | ✅ COMPLETE | 139 passed, 0 failed | `test_architecture.py` (37 comprehensive tests + 6 schema validation tests fixed) |\n    30→\n    31→**Files Created/Modified:**\n    32→- `vista/templates/plan-schema.json` — Schema cleanup complete\n    33→- `vista/server/services/chat_service.py` — Chat CLI with plain text output\n    34→- `vista/server/routes/chat.py` — POST /api/projects/{id}/chat endpoint\n    35→- `vista/server/app.py` — Chat router registered\n    36→- `vista/tests/test_architecture.py` — 37 tests for arch + chat features\n    37→- `vista/tests/test_api.py` — 5 failing tests removed\n    38→\n    39→**Acceptance Criteria Status:**\n    40→- [x] **Phase 4:** Legacy test cleanup complete (5 failing tests deleted)\n    41→- [x] **Phase 1:** Schema cleanup complete (7 legacy/duplicate sections removed)\n    42→- [x] **Phase 2:** Chat service + API complete (chat now functional)\n    43→- [x] **Phase 3:** Test coverage complete (37 comprehensive tests + 6 schema validation tests fixed)\n    44→- [ ] **Phase 5:** Polish (Draw.io viewer, SSE streaming, markdown rendering)\n    45→- [ ] **Phase 6:** Documentation updates (AGENTS.md corrections)\n    46→\n    47→### Schema Validation Tests Fixed (2026-02-11)\n    48→\n    49→Fixed 6 failing schema validation tests in `test_architecture.py`:\n    50→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e23a7aa2-5923-4855-9cc2-f80458cf6b25","uuid":"a1e31916-4ad8-42a7-80f1-5e8edf21a359","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:/Users/Grove/OneDrive/Documents/PYTHON/claude_plugins/vista-expanded-visualization/.vista/features/diagram_representations/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md","content":"# Implementation Plan: diagram_representations\n\n**Status:** IMPLEMENTATION COMPLETE — Phases 1-4 delivered, Phase 5 partial (SSE streaming done, Draw.io deferred)\n**Last Updated:** 2026-02-15 (Spec alignment pass: chat architecture updated to protocol-native, session persistence documented)\n**Next Action:** Phase 5.1 (Draw.io viewer), Phase 6 (Documentation)\n\n---\n\n## Invalidation Findings (Iteration 5 — stream-json Format Discovery)\n\n| # | Previous Plan Claim | Verified Reality | Impact |\n|---|---------------------|-----------------|--------|\n| 1 | Phase 2 says \"Gets invocation snippet via `provider.get_invocation(shell)`\" then \"Read stdout, return response text\" | ClaudeProvider's `get_invocation()` uses `--output-format=stream-json` (provider_service.py:134,141). CLI output is structured JSON lines, NOT plain text. | Chat service must NOT reuse loop invocation template directly |\n\n**Decision:** The chat service should build its own CLI command for the Claude provider, using `claude -p --model $Model` **without** `--output-format=stream-json` or `--verbose`. This produces plain text output suitable for JSON `{response}` wrapping. OpenCodeProvider's invocation (`opencode run --model $Model $PromptContent`) already returns plain text. See updated Phase 2.1 below.\n\n### All Prior Findings Confirmed (Iterations 1-4 — Still Accurate)\n- **Test suite: 104 passed, 5 failed, 2 warnings** — re-confirmed by running pytest\n- 5 failing tests: all in `TestVistaPlanAPI` class (lines 271-427) testing removed endpoints\n- plan-schema.json: 3 duplicated sections (uiFlows, dataModels, dataFlow) at exact line numbers + services once at 146-179\n\n### Iteration 6 — BUILD Iteration Results (All Phases 1-4 Complete)\n\n| Phase | Status | Tests | Files Changed |\n|-------|--------|-------|---------------|\n| 4 | ✅ COMPLETE | 139 passed, 0 failed (was 104 passed, 5 failed) | `test_api.py` — removed TestVistaPlanAPI class |\n| 1 | ✅ COMPLETE | 139 passed, 0 failed | `plan-schema.json` — removed 7 legacy/duplicate sections |\n| 2 | ✅ COMPLETE | 139 passed, 0 failed | `chat_service.py`, `chat.py`, `app.py` |\n| 3 | ✅ COMPLETE | 139 passed, 0 failed | `test_architecture.py` (37 comprehensive tests + 6 schema validation tests fixed) |\n\n**Files Created/Modified:**\n- `vista/templates/plan-schema.json` — Schema cleanup complete\n- `vista/server/services/chat_service.py` — Chat CLI with plain text output\n- `vista/server/routes/chat.py` — POST /api/projects/{id}/chat endpoint\n- `vista/server/app.py` — Chat router registered\n- `vista/tests/test_architecture.py` — 37 tests for arch + chat features\n- `vista/tests/test_api.py` — 5 failing tests removed\n\n**Acceptance Criteria Status:**\n- [x] **Phase 4:** Legacy test cleanup complete (5 failing tests deleted)\n- [x] **Phase 1:** Schema cleanup complete (7 legacy/duplicate sections removed)\n- [x] **Phase 2:** Chat service + API complete (chat now functional)\n- [x] **Phase 3:** Test coverage complete (37 comprehensive tests + 6 schema validation tests fixed)\n- [ ] **Phase 5:** Polish (Draw.io viewer, SSE streaming, markdown rendering)\n- [ ] **Phase 6:** Documentation updates (AGENTS.md corrections)\n\n### Schema Validation Tests Fixed (2026-02-11)\n\nFixed 6 failing schema validation tests in `test_architecture.py`:\n","numLines":50,"startLine":1,"totalLines":499}}}
